 "observations": [
  "The page number «245» stands at the head of the page, centred, with a rule below it. The page has no signature. Two columns divided by a vertical rule, as on pp. [241]-244 (JP2 0275-0278), transcribed column by column: the left column L01-L50, the right L51-L97; the letter heads «N.» (L42), «O.» (L51), «R.» (L55) and «S.» (L79) in bold, centred in their columns, «N.», «R.» and «S.» each after a blank line; each entry begins at the edge of its column, its further lines indented.",
  "L67: the fraction is built up, «1» over «60⁴», the 4 raised, written {fr:NUMERATOR|DENOMINATOR}. The semicolons of L21, L32, L39, L64, L68, L69 and L93 stand after a thin space (6-11 px); written with a space. L61: «etc» without its point, at the end of the entry «Rabe elachir»; the other entries of the months end with «etc.»; L92: the f of «ashrāf» is printed without its upper hook, a damaged sort; transcribed f. «Otari[d]» (L52) with the brackets as printed. The dashes are long.",
  "Checked against the text: the forms of the headwords occur where the references point, for example «Mobzota» in Tab. 15 (p. 126, JP2 0158), «Muaddala» on p. 13 (JP2 0045), «Muchre» on p. 9 (JP2 0041), «Mukaam» in Tab. 54 (p. 165, JP2 0197), «Munegim» on p. XXII (JP2 0026), «elfelek elmustakim» on p. 18 (JP2 0050), «Nadair» on p. XX (JP2 0024), «Nuzf» in Tab. 73 (p. 187, JP2 0219), «Ozari» in Tab. 17-18 (pp. 128-129), «Race elhamel» on p. 20 (JP2 0052), «Raz» on p. 18, «Ramadham» on p. XIV (JP2 0018), «Scawal» in Tab. 3 and 9 (pp. 113, 120), «Sana» on pp. 30 and 34; the months as named in the tables of the mean motions and of the conversion of years (Tab. 2-20, 72). The numbering of the Arab months is correct: Muḥarram the first, Rabīʿ al-awwal the third, Rabīʿ al-ākhir the fourth, Radjab the seventh, Shaʿbān the eighth, Ramaḍān the ninth, Shawwāl the tenth."
